I chose a **single-stage NMOS-input folded-cascode OTA** with a low-voltage cascode NMOS mirror load. This is a sizing proposal for the optimiser; I have not run any SPICE yet, so all the numbers below are hand estimates.

## Why this topology
- **Gain:** the cascoded output should give about 60–70 dB, well above the 45 dB target.
- **Stability:** CL itself is the dominant pole, so no Miller capacitor is needed. The folding-node and mirror poles sit far above 150 MHz, so phase margin should be roughly 70–80°.
- **Input pair type:** with VCM = 0.9 V an NMOS pair is the only practical choice, because pfet |Vth| ≈ 1 V. The PMOS current sources and cascodes hold the folding nodes near 1.6 V.
- **Polarity:** vinp drives the folding branch on the mirror-input side, so vinp is the non-inverting input.

## Hand estimates
- **Input pair:** about 150 µA per side at gm/Id ≈ 15, giving gm1 ≈ 2.2 mS. With about 1.3 pF effective load, GBW ≈ 270 MHz.
- **Currents:** tail 300 µA, top PMOS sources about 250 µA each, cascode branches about 100 µA each.
- **Power:** total supply current ≈ 530 µA including the 10 µA reference, so about 0.95 mW against the 2 mW limit.

## Bias network
- A 10 µA diode sinks ibias and sets the tail current by mirroring.
- **PMOS bias:** a replica 10 µA branch through a PMOS diode sets `vbp`. The resistor R1 then drops `vbpc` to about 0.4 V, which keeps the top PMOS sources in saturation.
- **NMOS cascode bias:** a third 10 µA branch gives vbnc ≈ Vgs + 10 µA·R2 ≈ 1.0 V for the NMOS cascodes.
- **Mirror load:** the gate of M11/M12 is tied to node x, which forms a low-voltage cascode mirror.

```spice
.subckt dut vinp vinn vout vdd vss ibias
* ---- reference / bias ----
MB0  ibias ibias vss  vss nfet W={WB}  L={LN}
MT   tail  ibias vss  vss nfet W={WT}  L={LN}
MBP  vbp   vbp   vdd  vdd pfet W={WPB} L={LP}
R1   vbp   vbpc  {R1}
MN2  vbpc  ibias vss  vss nfet W={WB}  L={LN}
MP3  vbnc  vbp   vdd  vdd pfet W={WPB} L={LP}
R2   vbnc  nd    {R2}
MN3  nd    nd    vss  vss nfet W={WB}  L={LN}
* ---- NMOS input pair ----
M1   fa    vinp  tail vss nfet W={W1}  L={L1}
M2   fb    vinn  tail vss nfet W={W1}  L={L1}
* ---- PMOS current sources (fold) ----
M5   fa    vbp   vdd  vdd pfet W={WP}  L={LP}
M6   fb    vbp   vdd  vdd pfet W={WP}  L={LP}
* ---- PMOS cascodes ----
M7   x     vbpc  fa   vdd pfet W={WPC} L={LPC}
M8   vout  vbpc  fb   vdd pfet W={WPC} L={LPC}
* ---- NMOS low-voltage cascode mirror load ----
M9   x     vbnc  y    vss nfet W={WNC} L={LNC}
M10  vout  vbnc  z    vss nfet W={WNC} L={LNC}
M11  y     x     vss  vss nfet W={WNM} L={LNM}
M12  z     x     vss  vss nfet W={WNM} L={LNM}
.ends dut
```

